Sentinel so Git preserves this directory in a fresh checkout.

case_49_empty_directory must exist and contain NO dossier or schema artifacts:
it is the fixture that proves an empty directory fails the required_tables gate
in every validation mode. Git cannot track an empty directory, so without this
file the directory vanishes on clone and the fixture silently disappears --
which is what broke test_all_fixture_dirs_exist and
test_fixture_count_matches_directory on Linux CI.

This file is not a dossier table, not a schema, and not a freeze manifest. The
validator never sees it: its only directory scan is glob("freeze_manifest*.json"),
and the required_tables gate looks for named tables (events.csv, claims.csv, ...).
So case 49 keeps its exact expected verdict -- FAIL on required_tables in draft,
proposed and freeze modes. Do not add any other file here.
